- If all three are one person, they hold 668 lines (43.5%). This merge is not applied to the table.
- A larger group of other Felix Queißner addresses, 53 lines (3.5%), is also suggested as the same person. Those are not included in the 668.

**If that person stopped answering**
- When only the "Felix (xq) Queißner" spelling is removed, 384 lines (25.0%) have no author left. Counted by top owner, 6 of 12 files (1,052 lines) lose their main author. That includes `src/args.zig` (898 lines), `README.md`, `demo.zig` and the CI workflow.
- If the other spellings are the same person, the real loss is close to the 43.5% above. I didn't run that case, so I have no printed figure for it.
